  "steps": [
    "Blend together 1 Cup of basil, 2-3 cloves of garlic, 2 tsps olive oil, 4-5 walnuts, 1 cube grated cheese, salt, 1/4 tsp pepper.",
    "2.Please dont add water. It will take some time to grind and should be a coarse paste (not fine).",
    "You may add a tsp of oil if its not blending well after a few mins.",
    "Sauté some thinly slices onions and mushrooms. Let them caramelise. Season with salt, pepper, oregano.",
    "Sauté some Capsicum on high flame for 3-4 mins so its a little crunchy. Season with salt, pepper, chilliflakes.",
    "Roast 100g homemade low fat paneer (recipe on my page) with some sesame seeds until golden brown on both sides.",
    "Take 2 slices of multigrain bread and spread 1.5 tbsp of the pesto (use cautiously as its caloric dense).",
    "Add thinly sliced boiled beetroot, tomato, roasted paneer, sautéd onion, mushroom and capsicum. Also add half a slice of cheese. Season with oregano and chilli flakes.",
    "Toast the sandwich on both sides until crispy and dig in!!"
  ],
